      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In the case of all other professional services whose scope can be sufficiently defined and where there is more than one firm or organization capable of carrying out the project, work should be contracted for through a Request for Proposal (RFP) procedure as defined below. Payment for such professional services which are of a study or research nature should be made in accordance with the provisions of Budget Circular CS-15 and any modifications thereto issued by the Director of the Budget.",
